{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"scb47d7045c57535a","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-c87b67818b618ad8838a","text":"列车里怪怪的，好像有什么看不见的东西…","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-60fc6afadb3a082d918a","text":"有空回来看看啊啊啊！！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-9e12844fa7a9ea69fed4","text":"列车长的胆子也太小了","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-1b5da98a79e6644bf4fd","text":"列车长的胆子也太小了","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-4b383d57d2e7e9de7b67","text":"冷静，我这就回来","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-17b794bc3b9fb682fc64","text":"冷静，我这就回来","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-08b4dae9bc7713c85a8a","text":"快回来！这事不解决，列车休想发车帕！","speaker":"帕姆"}]}
